[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1440.63, "timestamp": "00:24:00", "text": "倒也不至于说很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1442.87, "timestamp": "00:24:02", "text": "啊，是的，我不玩孟买的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1446.47, "timestamp": "00:24:06", "text": "服务器。但这也太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1450.07, "timestamp": "00:24:10", "text": "太可怕了。确实很可怕。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1454.71, "timestamp": "00:24:14", "text": "可怕的。真的很可怕，我很害怕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1458.23, "timestamp": "00:24:18", "text": "甚至连麦克风都不敢打开。我知道我当时很糟糕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1460.63, "timestamp": "00:24:20", "text": "参加开放麦之类的活动的经历。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1463.11, "timestamp": "00:24:23", "text": "当时我就想，是啊，我永远不会开门。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1465.99, "timestamp": "00:24:25", "text": "在马洛尔的麦克风里，而且总是如此，尤其如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1470.07, "timestamp": "00:24:30", "text": "在孟买，服务从未如此糟糕。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1471.909, "timestamp": "00:24:31", "text": "女士"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1475.269, "timestamp": "00:24:35", "text": "是的，每次我打开弹匣的时候，我都不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1478.47, "timestamp": "00:24:38", "text": "去厨房，就像这样，你不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1481.669, "timestamp": "00:24:41", "text": "想让我进厨房？那可不安全。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1485.75, "timestamp": "00:24:45", "text": "一个适合任何人的地方，甚至对我来说也是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1488.71, "timestamp": "00:24:48", "text": "把房子烧掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1491.19, "timestamp": "00:24:51", "text": "你找错人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1494.07, "timestamp": "00:24:54", "text": "厨房。所以他们为什么要这么说呢？"}]